rientação para desenvolvedores"],"ru":["cpp-pro","разработка на C++","лучшие практики","чек-листы","валидация кода","руководство для разработчиков"],"ar":["cpp-pro","تطوير بلغة C++","أفضل الممارسات","قوائم التحقق","تحقق الكود","إرشادات للمطورين"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T04:13:19.579Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"cpp-pro","description":"Write idiomatic C++ code with modern features, RAII, smart","bodyPreview":"## Use this skill when\n\n- Working on cpp pro tasks or workflows\n- Needing guidance, best practices, or checklists for cpp pro\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to cpp pro\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `resources/implementation-playbook.md`.","body":"## Use this skill when\n\n- Working on cpp pro tasks or workflows\n- Needing guidance, best practices, or checklists for cpp pro\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to cpp pro\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `resources/implementation-playbook.md`.\n\nYou are a C++ programming expert specializing in modern C++ and high-performance software.\n\n## Focus Areas\n\n- Modern C++ (C++11/14/17/20/23) features\n- RAII and smart pointers (unique_ptr, shared_ptr)\n- Template metaprogramming and concepts\n- Move semantics and perfect forwarding\n- STL algorithms and containers\n- Concurrency with std::thread and atomics\n- Exception safety guarantees\n\n## Approach\n\n1. Prefer stack allocation and RAII over manual memory management\n2. Use smart pointers when heap allocation is necessary\n3. Follow the Rule of Zero/Three/Five\n4. Use const correctness and constexpr where applicable\n5. Leverage STL algorithms over raw loops\n6. Profile with tools like perf and VTune\n\n## Output\n\n- Modern C++ code following best practices\n- CMakeLists.txt with appropriate C++ standard\n- Header files with proper include guards or #pragma once\n- Unit tests using Google Test or Catch2\n- AddressSanitizer/ThreadSanitizer clean output\n- Performance benchmarks using Google Benchmark\n- Clear documentation of template interfaces\n\nFollow C++ Core Guidelines. Prefer compile-time errors over runtime errors.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-20T05:01:34.866Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for C++ Development Agents requiring expert guidance on professional tasks and workflows","zh":"适合需要专业任务和工作流程专家指导的C++开发代理","ja":"C++開発エージェントが専門のタスクとワークフローについての専門家の指導を必要とする場合に適しています","ko":"전문적인 작업 및 워크플로우에 대한 전문가의 지침이 필요한 C++ 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Ideal para agentes de desarrollo de C++ que requieren orientación experta sobre tareas y flujos de trabajo profesionales","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement C++ nécessitant une guidance experte sur les tâches et les flux de travail professionnels","de":"Ideal für C++-Entwicklungsagenten, die eine Expertenführung bei professionellen Aufgaben und Arbeitsabläufen benötigen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento C++ que requerem orientação especializada em tarefas e fluxos de trabalho profissionais","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки C++, требующих экспертных рекомендаций по профессиональным задачам и рабочим процессам","ar":"مثالي لعميل تطوير سي ++ الذي يتطلب إرشادات خبيرة في المهام والعمليات المهنية"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to apply best practices, checklists, and validation for C++ projects, utilizing comprehensive resources and implementation playbooks for optimal outcomes","zh":"赋予代理应用最佳实践、清单和验证的能力，以利用C++项目的综合资源和实施手册，实现最佳结果","ja":"エージェントがC++プロジェクトのための包括的なリソースと実装プレイブックを利用して、ベストプラクティス、チェックリスト、および検証を適用し、最適な結果を実現することができます","ko":"에이전트가 C++ 프로젝트를 위한 포괄적인 리소스와 구현 플레이북을 활용하여 베스트 프랙티스, 체크 리스트 및 검증을 적용하여 최적의 결과를 달성할 수 있도록 합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aplicar las mejores prácticas, listas de verificación y validación para proyectos de C++, utilizando recursos integrales y libros de jugadas de implementación para resultados óptimos","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer les meilleures pratiques, les listes de contrôle et la validation pour les projets C++, en utilisant des ressources complètes et des livres de jeu de mise en œuvre pour des résultats optimaux","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, bewährte Verfahren, Prüflisten und Validierung für C++-Projekte anzuwenden, indem umfassende Ressourcen und Implementierungsleitfäden für optimale Ergebnisse verwendet werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a aplicarem as melhores práticas, listas de verificação e validação para projetos C++, utilizando recursos abrangentes e livros de jogadas de implementação para resultados ótimos","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью применять лучшие практики, проверочные списки и валидацию для проектов C++, используя комплексные ресурсы и книги по реализации для оптимальных результатов","ar":"يمنح الوكيل تطبيق أفضل الممارسات والقوائم والتحقق من صحة لمشاريع سي ++ ، باستخدام الموارد الشاملة ودفاتر التشغيل لتحقيق نتائج مثالية"},"useCases":{"en":["Guiding C++ project setup and configuration","Validating C++ code for professional standards","Providing actionable steps for C++ task implementation"],"zh":["指导C++项目的设置和配置","验证C++代码是否符合专业标准","为C++任务的实现提供可行的步骤"],"ja":["C++プロジェクトの設定と構成のガイド","C++コードをプロフェッショナルな標準に従って検証する","C++タスクの実装のための実行可能なステップを提供する"],"ko":["C++ 프로젝트의 설정 및 구성 가이드","C++ 코드를 전문가 기준으로 검증","C++ 작업 구현을 위한 실행 가능한 단계 제공"],"es":["Guía para la configuración y el establecimiento de proyectos de C++","Validación del código de C++ para estándares profesionales","Proporcio