description":{"zh":"代码安全所有权地图是一种构建人和文件的二分图的方法，计算所有权风险，并导出图形化数据","ja":"コードセキュリティ所有権マップは、人とファイルの二分グラフを構築し、所有権リスクを計算し、グラフィカルデータをエクスポートする方法です","ko":"코드 보안 소유권 맵은 사람과 파일의 이분 그래프를 구축하고 소유권 위험을 계산하여 그래픽 데이터를 내보내는 방법입니다","es":"El mapa de propiedad de seguridad es una herramienta que ayuda a identificar y gestionar los riesgos de seguridad en proyectos de código abierto","fr":"La carte de propriété de sécurité est un outil qui aide à identifier et gérer les risques de sécurité dans les projets de code ouvert","de":"Die Sicherheitseigentums-Karte ist ein Werkzeug, das dabei hilft, Sicherheitsrisiken in Open-Source-Projekten zu identifizieren und zu verwalten","pt":"O mapa de propriedade de segurança é uma ferramenta que constrói um grafo bipartido de pessoas e arquivos do histórico do Git","ru":"Карта собственности безопасности - это инструмент, который строит двудольный граф людей и файлов из истории Git","ar":"خريطة ملكية الأمان هي أداة تبني مخططًا ثنائي القسم للأشخاص والملفات من تاريخ Git","en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"definition":{"en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"features":{"zh":["构建人和文件的二分图","计算所有权风险","导出图形化数据","支持Neo4j和Gephi","使用Python 3和networkx库"],"ja":["人とファイルの二分グラフを構築","所有権リスクを計算","グラフィカルデータをエクスポート","Neo4jとGephiをサポート","Python 3とnetworkxライブラリを使用"],"ko":["사람과 파일의 이분 그래프를 구축","소유권 위험을 계산","그래픽 데이터를 내보냄","Neo4j와 Gephi를 지원","Python 3와 networkx 라이브러리를 사용"],"es":["Creación de un grafo bipartito de personas y archivos","Detección de comunidades con NetworkX","Cálculo de riesgos de propiedad","Exportación de artefactos de grafo para Neo4j y Gephi"],"fr":["Création d''un graphe bipartite de personnes et de fichiers","Détection de communautés avec NetworkX","Calcul des risques de propriété","Exportation d''artefacts de graphe pour Neo4j et Gephi"],"de":["Erstellung eines bipartiten Graphen von Personen und Dateien","Community-Erkennung mit NetworkX","Berechnung von Eigentumsrisiken","Export von Graph-Artefakten für Neo4j und Gephi"],"pt":["Constrói um grafo bipartido de pessoas e arquivos","Compute o risco de propriedade","Exporta artefatos de grafo para Neo4j/Gephi","Cria um grafo de co-mudança de arquivos","Ignora commits grandes e barulhentos"],"ru":["Постройте двудольный граф людей и файлов","Вычислите риск собственности","Экспортируйте графические артефакты в Neo4j/Gephi","Создайте граф совместного изменения файлов","Игнорируйте большие и шумные коммиты"],"ar":["ابني مخططًا ثنائي القسم للأشخاص والملفات","احسب مخاطر الملكية","استخرج مخططات γραφيكس إلى Neo4j/Gephi","أنشئ مخططًا لتغيير الملفات المشترك","تجاهل الالتزامات الكبيرة والصاخبة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["代码安全","所有权地图","二分图","所有权风险","图形化数据","Neo4j","Gephi","Python 3","networkx"],"ja":["コードセキュリティ","所有権マップ","二分グラフ","所有権リスク","グラフィカルデータ","Neo4j","Gephi","Python 3","networkx"],"ko":["코드 보안","소유권 맵","이분 그래프","소유권 위험","그래픽 데이터","Neo4j","Gephi","Python 3","networkx"],"es":["seguridad de código abierto","mapa de propiedad de seguridad","grafo bipartito","detección de comunidades","NetworkX","Neo4j","Gephi"],"fr":["sécurité du code ouvert","carte de propriété de sécurité","graphe bipartite","détection de communautés","NetworkX","Neo4j","Gephi"],"de":["Sicherheit von Open-Source-Code","Sicherheitseigentums-Karte","bipartiter Graph","Community-Erkennung","NetworkX","Neo4j","Gephi"],"pt":["segurança de código","mapa de propriedade","grafo bipartido","risco de propriedade","Neo4j","Gephi","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["безопасность кода","карта собственности","двудольный граф","риск собственности","Neo4j","Gephi","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["أمان الكود","خريطة ملكية","مخطط ثنائي القسم","مخاطر الملكية","Neo4j","Gephi","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T04:13:19.579Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"security-ownership-map","description":"Analyze git repositories to build a security ownership topology (people-to-file), compute bus factor and sensitive-code ownership, and export CSV/JSON for graph databases and visualization. Trigger only when the user explicitly wants a security-oriented ownership or bus-factor analysis grounded in git history (for example: orphaned sensitive code, security maintainers, CODEOWNERS reality checks for risk, sensitive hotspots, or ownership clusters). Do not trigger for general maintainer lists or non-security ownership questions.","bodyPreview":"# Security Ownership Map\n\n## Overview\n\nBuild a bipartite graph of people and files from git history, then compute ownership risk and export graph artifacts for Neo4j/Gephi. Also build a file co-change graph (Jaccard similarity on shared commits) to cluster files by how they move together while ignoring large, noisy commits.\n\n## Requirements\n\n- Python 3\n- `networkx` (required; community detection is enabled by default)\n\nInstall with:\n\n```bash\npip install networkx\n```\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. Scope the re","body":"# Security Ownership Map\n\n## Overview\n\nBuild a bipartite graph of people and files from git history, then compute ownership risk and export graph artifacts for Neo4j/Gephi. Also build a file co-change graph (Jaccard similarity on shared commits) to cluster files by how they move together while ignoring large, noisy commits.\n\n## Requirements\n\n- Python 3\n- `networkx` (required; community detection is enabled by default)\n\nInstall with:\n\n```bash\npip install networkx\n```\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. Scope the repo and time window (optional `--since/--until`).\n2. Decide sensitivity rules (use defaults or provide a CSV config).\n3. Build the ownership map with `scripts/run_ownership_map.py` (co-change graph is on by default; use `--cochange-max-files` to ignore supernode commits).\n4. Communities are computed by default; graphml output is optional (`--graphml`).\n5. Query the outputs with `scripts/query_ownership.py` for bounded JSON slices.\n6. Persist and visualize (see `references/neo4j-import.md`).\n\nBy default, the co-change graph ignores common “glue” files (lockfiles, `.github/*`, editor config) so clusters reflect actual code movement instead of shared infra edits. Override with `--cochange-exclude` or `--no-default-cochange-excludes`. Dependabot commits are excluded by default; override with `--no-default-author-excludes` or add patterns via `--author-exclude-regex`.\n\nIf you want to exclude Linux build glue like `Kbuild` from co-change clustering, pass:\n\n```bash\npython skills/skills/security-ownership-map/scripts/run_ownership_map.py \\\n  --repo /path/to/linux \\\n  --out ownership-map-out \\\n  --cochange-exclude \"**/Kbuild\"\n```\n\n## Quick start\n\nRun from the repo root:\n\n```bash\npython skills/skills/security-ownership-map/scripts/run_ownership_map.py \\\n  --repo . \\\n  --out ownership-map-out \\\n  --since \"12 months ago\" \\\n  --emit-commits\n```\n\nDefaults: author identity, author date, and merge commits excluded. Use `--identity committer`, `--date-field committer`, or `--include-merges` if needed.\n\nExample (override co-change excludes):\n\n```bash\npython skills/skills/security-ownership-map/scripts/run_ownership_map.py \\\n  --repo . \\\n  --out ownership-map-out \\\n  --cochange-exclude \"**/Cargo.lock\" \\\n  --cochange-exclude \"**/.github/**\" \\\n  --no-default-cochange-excludes\n```\n\nCommunities are computed by default. To disable:\n\n```bash\npython skills/skills/security-ownership-map/scripts/run_ownership_map.py \\\n  --repo . \\\n  --out ownership-map-out \\\n  --no-communities\n```\n\n## Sensitivity rules\n\nBy default, the script flags common auth/crypto/secret paths. Override by providing a CSV file:\n\n```\n# pattern,tag,weight\n**/auth/**,auth,1.0\n**/crypto/**,crypto,1.0\n**/*.pem,secrets,1.0\n```\n\nUse it with `--sensitive-config path/to/sensitive.csv`.\n\n## Output artifacts\n\n`ownership-map-out/` contains:\n\n- `people.csv` (nodes: people)\n- `files.csv` (nodes: files)\n- `edges.csv` (edges: touches)\n- `cochange_edges.csv` (file-to-file co-change edges with Jaccard weight; omitted with `--no-cochange`)\n- `summary.json` (security ownership findings)\n- `commits.jsonl` (optional, if `--emit-commits`)\n- `communities.json` (computed by default from co-change edges when available; includes `maintainers` per community; disable with `--no-communities`)\n- `cochange.graph.json` (NetworkX node-link JSON with `community_id` + `community_maintainers`; falls back to `ownership.graph.json` if no co-change edges)\n- `ownership.graphml` / `cochange.graphml` (optional, if `--graphml`)\n\n`people.csv` includes timezone detection based on author commit offsets: `primary_tz_offset`, `primary_tz_minutes`, and `timezone_offsets`.\n\n## LLM query helper\n\nUse `scripts/query_ownership.py` to return small, JSON-bounded slices without loading the full graph into context.\n\nExamples:\n\n```bash\npython skills/skills/security-ownership-map/scripts/query_ownership.py --data-dir ownership-map-out people --limit 10\npython skills/skills/security-ownership-map/scripts/query_ownership.py --data-dir ownership-map-out files --tag auth --bus-factor-max 1\npython skills/skills/security-ownership-map/scripts/query_ownership.py --data-dir ownership-map-out person --person alice@corp --limit 10\npython skills/skills/security-ownership-map/scripts/query_ownership.py --data-dir ownership-map-out file --file crypto/tls\npython skills/skills/security-ownership-map/scripts/query_ownership.py --data-dir ownership-map-out cochange --file crypto/tls --limit 10\npython skills/skills/security-ownership-map/scripts/query_ownership.py --data-dir ownership-map-out summary --section orphaned_sensitive_code\npython skills/skills/security-ownership-map/scripts/query_ownership.py --data-dir ownership-map-out community --id 3\n```\n\nUse `--community-top-owners 5` (default) to control how many maintainers are stored per community.\n\n## Basic security queries\n\nRun these to answer common security ownership questions with bounded output:\n\n```bash\n# Orphaned sensitive code (stale + low bus factor)\npython skills/skills/security-ownership-map/scripts/query_ownership.py --data-dir ownership-map-out summary --section orphaned_sensitive_code\n\n# Hidden owners for sensitive tags\npython skills/skills/security-ownership-map/scripts/query_ownership.py --data-dir ownership-map-out summary --section hidden_owners\n\n# Sensitive hotspots with low bus factor\npython skills/skills/security-ownership-map/scripts/query_ownership.py --data-dir ownership-map-out summary --section bus_factor_hotspots\n\n# Auth/crypto files with bus factor <= 1\npython skills/skills/security-ownership-map/scripts/query_ownership.py --data-dir ownership-map-out files --tag auth --bus-factor-max 1\npython skills/skills/security-ownership-map/scripts/query_ownership.py --data-dir ownership-map-out files --tag crypto --bus-factor-max 1\n\n# Who is touching sensitive code the most\npython skills/skills/security-ownership-map/scripts/query_ownership.py --data-dir ownership-map-out people --sort sensitive_touches --limit 10\n\n# Co-change neighbors (cluster hints for ownership drift)\npython skills/skills/security-ownership-map/scripts/query_ownership.py --data-dir ownership-map-out cochange --file path/to/file --min-jaccard 0.05 --limit 20\n\n# Community maintainers (for a cluster)\npython skills/skills/security-ownership-map/scripts/query_ownership.py --data-dir ownership-map-out community --id 3\n\n# Monthly maintainers for the community containing a file\npython skills/skills/security-ownership-map/scripts/community_maintainers.py \\\n  --data-dir ownership-map-out \\\n  --file network/card.c \\\n  --since 2025-01-01 \\\n  --top 5\n\n# Quarterly buckets instead of monthly\npython skills/skills/security-ownership-map/scripts/community_maintainers.py \\\n  --data-dir ownership-map-out \\\n  --file network/card.c \\\n  --since 2025-01-01 \\\n  --bucket quarter \\\n  --top 5\n```\n\nNotes:\n- Touches default to one authored commit (not per-file). Use `--touch-mode file` to count per-file touches.\n- Use `--window-days 90` or `--weight recency --half-life-days 180` to smooth churn.\n- Filter bots with `--ignore-author-regex ''(bot|dependabot)''`.\n- Use `--min-share 0.1` to show stable maintainers only.\n- Use `--bucket quarter` for calendar quarter groupings.\n- Use `--identity committer` or `--date-field committer` to switch from author attribution.\n- Use `--include-merges` to include merge commits (excluded by default).\n\n### Summary format (default)\n\nUse this structure, add fields if needed:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"orphaned_sensitive_code\": [\n    {\n      \"path\": \"crypto/tls/handshake.rs\",\n      \"last_security_touch\": \"2023-03-12T18:10:04+00:00\",\n      \"bus_factor\": 1\n    }\n  ],\n  \"hidden_owners\": [\n    {\n      \"person\": \"alice@corp\",\n      \"controls\": \"63% of auth code\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n## Graph persistence\n\nUse `references/neo4j-import.md` when you need to load the CSVs into Neo4j. It includes constraints, import Cypher, and visualization tips.\n\n## Notes\n\n- `bus_factor_hotspots` in `summary.json` lists sensitive files with low bus factor; `orphaned_sensitive_code` is the stale subset.\n- If `git log` is too large, narrow with `--since` or `--until`.\n- Compare `summary.json` against CODEOWNERS to highlight ownership drift.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-20T05:02:27.579Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Analysis Agents needing advanced security visualization and ownership mapping capabilities in Python.","zh":"非常适合需要高级安全可视化和所有权映射功能的 Python 代码分析代理。","ja":"Python で高度なセキュリティ可視化と所有権マッピング機能が必要なコード分析エージェントに最適です。","ko":"파이썬에서 고급 보안 시각화 및 소유권 매핑 기능이 필요한 코드 분석 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Análisis de Código que necesitan capacidades de visualización de seguridad avanzada y asignación de propietarios en Python.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Analyse de Code nécessitant des capacités de visualisation de sécurité avancées et de cartographie de propriété en Python.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Analyse-Agents, die erweiterte Sicherheitsvisualisierung und Eigentümerzuordnungsfunktionen in Python benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Código que necessitam de visualização de segurança avançada e capacidades de mapeamento de propriedade em Python.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов анализа кода, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности визуализации безопасности и сопоставления прав собственности в Python.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذين يحتاجون إلى تحليل الشفرة المتقدمة مع تمثيل أمان متقدم وقدرات التمويل في بايثون."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to compute ownership risk and export graph artifacts for Neo4j/Gephi using networkx, while also building file co-change graphs through Jaccard similarity on shared commits.","zh":"赋予代理计算所有权风险并使用 networkx 将图形制品导出到 Neo4j/Gephi 的能力，同时也可以通过共享提交的 Jaccard 相似度构建文件协同更改图。","ja":"エージェントが所有権リスクを計算し、networkx を使用してグラフアーティファクトを Neo4j/Gephi にエクスポートする機能を提供する，同时、共有コミットの Jaccard 類似度を使用してファイルの共同変更グラフを構築する。","ko":"에이전트가 소유권 위험을 계산하고 networkx를 사용하여 그래프 아티팩트를 Neo4j/Gephi에 내보내는 기능을 제공하며,同時에 공유 커밋의 Jaccard 유사도를 사용하여 파일의 공동 변경 그래프를 구축합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes para calcular el riesgo de propiedad y exportar artefactos de gráficos para Neo4j/Gephi utilizando networkx, y también para construir gráficos de co-cambio de archivos a través de la similitud de Jaccard en commits compartidos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de calculer le risque de propriété et d''exporter des artefacts de graphiques pour Neo4j/Gephi en utilisant networkx, tout en construisant des graphiques de co-changement de fichiers via la similarité de Jaccard sur les commits partagés.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, den Eigentumsrisiko zu berechnen und Graph-Artefakte für Neo4j/Gephi mit networkx zu exportieren, während auch Datei-Co-Änderungs-Graphen durch Jaccard-Ähnlichkeit auf gemeinsamen Commits erstellt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a calcular o risco de propriedade e exportar artefatos de grafo para Neo4j/Gephi usando networkx, além de construir gráficos de co-mudança de arquivos por meio da semelhança de Jaccard em commits compartilhados.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью рассчитывать риск собственности и экспортировать графические артефакты для Neo4j/Gephi с использованием networkx, а также строить графики совместных изменений файлов с помощью сходства Джаккарда в общих коммитах.","ar":"يمكّن الوكلاء من حساب مخاطر الملكية وتصدير مكونات الرسم البياني إلى Neo4j/Gephi باستخدام networkx، بالإضافة إلى بناء رسومات لتغييرات الملفات المشتركة من خلال تشابه Jaccard في التعهدات المشتركة."},"useCases":{"en":["Building bipartite graphs of people and files from git history","Computing ownership risk for code repositories","Clustering files by co-change patterns using Jaccard similarity"],"zh":["从 Git 历史记录中构建人与文件的二部图","计算代码仓库的所有权风险","使用 Jaccard 相似度对文件进行聚类以显示协同更改模式"],"ja":["Git の履歴から人とファイルの二部グラフを構築する","コードリポジトリの所有権リスクを計算する","Jaccard 類似度を使用してファイルをクラスタリングし、共同変更パターンを表示する"],"ko":["Git 기록에서 사람과 파일의 이분 그래프를 구축하는 것","코드 저장소의 소유권 위험을 계산하는 것","Jaccard 유사도를 사용하여 파일을 클러스터링하여 공동 변경 패턴을 표시하는 것"],"es":["Construir gráficos bipartitos de personas y archivos a partir del historial de git","Calcular el riesgo de propiedad para repositorios de código","Agrupar archivos por patrones de co-cambio utilizando la similitud de Jaccard"],"fr":["Construire des graphiques bipartites de personnes et de fichiers à partir de l''historique de git","Calculer le risque de propriété pour les référentiels de code","Regrouper des fichiers par des modèles de co-changement en utilisant la similarité de Jaccard"],"de":["Bipartite Graphen von Personen und Dateien aus der Git-Historie erstellen","Eigentumsrisiko für Code-Repositorys berechnen","Dateien nach Co-Änderungsmustern mit Jaccard-Ähnlichkeit gruppieren"],"pt":["Construir grafos bipartidos de pessoas e arquivos a partir do histórico do git","Calcular o risco de propriedade para repositórios de código","Agrupar arquivos por padrões de co-mudança usando semelhança de Jaccard"],"ru":["Построение бипартитных графов людей и файлов из истории git","Расчет риска собственности для репозиториев кода","Кластеризация файлов по закономерностям совместных изменений с помощью сходства Джаккарда"],"ar":["بناء رسومات ثنائية الأجزاء للأشخاص والملفات من تاريخ git","حساب مخاطر الملكية لمخازن الشفرة","تجميع الملفات وفقًا لأنماط التغيير المشترك باستخدام تشابه Jaccard"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python 3","Dependent on networkx library","Limited to analyzing git history"],"zh":["需要 Python 3","依赖 networkx 库","仅限于分析 Git 历史记录"],"ja":["Python 3 が必要","networkx ライブラリに依存する","Git の履歴の分析のみに限定される"],"ko":["Python 3이 필요합니다","networkx 라이브러리에 종속됩니다","Git 기록 분석만으로 제한됩니다"],"es":["Requiere Python 3","Dependiente de la biblioteca networkx","Limitado a analizar el historial de git"],"fr":["Nécessite Python 3","Dépend de la bibliothèque networkx","Limité à l''analyse de l''historique de git"],"de":["Benötigt Python 3","Abhängig von der Bibliothek networkx","Begrenzt auf die Analyse der Git-Historie"],"pt":["Requer Python 3","Dependente da biblioteca networkx","Limitado à análise do histórico do git"],"ru":["Требуется Python 3","Зависит от библиотеки networkx","Ограничен анализом истории git"],"ar":["يتطلب Python 3","يعتمد على مكتبة networkx","محدود بتحليل تاريخ git"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"f06c1a59247569326702c945f397af163ea96cf2ecfdf2dde280605bf89a3ec8","qualityScore":65}');
