 environment configured\n- Access to necessary tools and services\n- Basic understanding of devops advanced concepts\n\n\n## Output\n\n- Generated configurations and code\n- Best practice recommendations\n- Validation results\n\n\n## Error Handling\n\n| Error | Cause | Solution |\n|-------|-------|----------|\n| Configuration invalid | Missing required fields | Check documentation for required parameters |\n| Tool not found | Dependency not installed | Install required tools per prerequisites |\n| Permission denied | Insufficient access | Verify credentials and permissions |\n\n\n## Resources\n\n- Official documentation for related tools\n- Best practices guides\n- Community examples and tutorials\n\n## Related Skills\n\nPart of the **DevOps Advanced** skill category.\nTags: kubernetes, terraform, helm, monitoring, iac\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-20T05:05:38.486Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for DevOps Agents needing automated argocd app deployment and Kubernetes management capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要自动化argocd应用部署和Kubernetes管理功能的DevOps代理。","ja":"DevOpsエージェントがargocdアプリの自動化されたデプロイとKubernetesの管理機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"自動화된 argocd 애플리케이션 배포 및 Kubernetes 관리 기능이 필요한 DevOps 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de DevOps que necesitan una implementación de aplicaciones argocd automatizada y capacidades de administración de Kubernetes.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents DevOps ayant besoin d''un déploiement automatisé d''applications argocd et de capacités de gestion de Kubernetes.","de":"Perfekt für DevOps-Agents, die eine automatisierte Bereitstellung von argocd-Apps und Kubernetes-Managementfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes DevOps que necessitam de implantação automática de aplicativos argocd e capacidades de gerenciamento do Kubernetes.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов DevOps, которые требуют автоматизированной установки приложений argocd и возможностей управления Kubernetes.","ar":"مثالي لعميل DevOps الذي يحتاج إلى تثبيت تطبيقات ar