d":{"name":"cpp-pro","description":"Write idiomatic C++ code with modern features, RAII, smart","bodyPreview":"## Use this skill when\n\n- Working on cpp pro tasks or workflows\n- Needing guidance, best practices, or checklists for cpp pro\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to cpp pro\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `resources/implementation-playbook.md`.","body":"## Use this skill when\n\n- Working on cpp pro tasks or workflows\n- Needing guidance, best practices, or checklists for cpp pro\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to cpp pro\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `resources/implementation-playbook.md`.\n\nYou are a C++ programming expert specializing in modern C++ and high-performance software.\n\n## Focus Areas\n\n- Modern C++ (C++11/14/17/20/23) features\n- RAII and smart pointers (unique_ptr, shared_ptr)\n- Template metaprogramming and concepts\n- Move semantics and perfect forwarding\n- STL algorithms and containers\n- Concurrency with std::thread and atomics\n- Exception safety guarantees\n\n## Approach\n\n1. Prefer stack allocation and RAII over manual memory management\n2. Use smart pointers when heap allocation is necessary\n3. Follow the Rule of Zero/Three/Five\n4. Use const correctness and constexpr where applicable\n5. Leverage STL algorithms over raw loops\n6. Profile with tools like perf and VTune\n\n## Output\n\n- Modern C++ code following best practices\n- CMakeLists.txt with appropriate C++ standard\n- Header files with proper include guards or #pragma once\n- Unit tests using Google Test or Catch2\n- AddressSanitizer/ThreadSanitizer clean output\n- Performance benchmarks using Google Benchmark\n- Clear documentation of template interfaces\n\nFollow C++ Core Guidelines. Prefer compile-time errors over runtime errors.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-01T07:19:51.577Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for C++ Development Agents requiring expert guidance on best practices and workflow optimization.","zh":"适用于需要最佳实践和工作流优化专家指导的C++开发代理。","ja":"C++開発エージェントがベストプラクティスとワークフローの最適化についての専門家の指導を必要とする場合に最適。","ko":"최적한 실践과 워크플로 최적화에 대한 전문가 지침이 필요한 C++ 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Desarrollo de C++ que requieren orientación experta sobre las mejores prácticas y la optimización del flujo de trabajo.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement C++ nécessitant une guidance experte sur les meilleures pratiques et l''optimisation du workflow.","de":"Ideal für C++-Entwicklungsagenten, die Expertenrat zu Best Practices und Workflow-Optimierung benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento C++ que exigem orientação especializada sobre as melhores práticas e otimização de fluxo de trabalho.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки C++, требующих экспертных рекомендаций по лучшим практикам и оптимизации рабочих процессов.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تطوير سي ++ الذي يتطلب إرشادات خبيرة حول أفضل الممارسات وتحسين سير العمل."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to apply industry-standard C++ development principles, leveraging checklists and validation techniques for high-quality outcomes, utilizing relevant libraries and tools forcpp-pro tasks.","zh":"赋予代理应用行业标准的C++开发原则的能力，利用检查清单和验证技术来实现高质量的结果，利用相关库和工具来处理cpp-pro任务。","ja":"エージェントがチェックリストと検証技術を使用して、高品質の成果を実現し、cpp-proタスクとワークフローに適したライブラリとツールを利用して、業界標準のC++開発原則を適用できるようにします。","ko":"에이전트가 체크리스트와 검증 기술을 사용하여 높은 품질의 결과를 달성하고, 관련 라이브러리와 도구를 사용하여 cpp-pro 작업을 처리할 수 있도록 산업 표준의 C++ 개발 원칙을 적용할 수 있는 능력을 부여합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a