utliner","criação de esboços de slides","produtividade","ferramentas de apresentação","documentação visual","padrões de apresentação"],"ru":["создатель конспекта слайда презентации","создание конспектов слайдов","производительность","инструменты презентации","визуальная документация","шаблоны презентации"],"ar":["مُصمم مخطط عرض شرائح","إنشاء مخططات شرائح","الإنتاجية","أدوات العرض","توثيق بصرية","نماذج العرض"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T04:13:19.580Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"presentation-slide-outliner","description":"|","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Presentation Slide Outliner\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill provides automated assistance for presentation slide outliner tasks within the Visual Content domain.\n\n## When to Use\n\nThis skill activates automatically when you:\n- Mention \"presentation slide outliner\" in your request\n- Ask about presentation slide outliner patterns or best practices\n- Need help with visual content skills covering diagrams, charts, presentations, and visual documentation tools.\n\n## Instructions\n\n1. Provides step-by-step gu","body":"# Presentation Slide Outliner\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill provides automated assistance for presentation slide outliner tasks within the Visual Content domain.\n\n## When to Use\n\nThis skill activates automatically when you:\n- Mention \"presentation slide outliner\" in your request\n- Ask about presentation slide outliner patterns or best practices\n- Need help with visual content skills covering diagrams, charts, presentations, and visual documentation tools.\n\n## Instructions\n\n1. Provides step-by-step guidance for presentation slide outliner\n2. Follows industry best practices and patterns\n3. Generates production-ready code and configurations\n4. Validates outputs against common standards\n\n## Examples\n\n**Example: Basic Usage**\nRequest: \"Help me with presentation slide outliner\"\nResult: Provides step-by-step guidance and generates appropriate configurations\n\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Relevant development environment configured\n- Access to necessary tools and services\n- Basic understanding of visual content concepts\n\n\n## Output\n\n- Generated configurations and code\n- Best practice recommendations\n- Validation results\n\n\n## Error Handling\n\n| Error | Cause | Solution |\n|-------|-------|----------|\n| Configuration invalid | Missing required fields | Check documentation for required parameters |\n| Tool not found | Dependency not installed | Install required tools per prerequisites |\n| Permission denied | Insufficient access | Verify credentials and permissions |\n\n\n## Resources\n\n- Official documentation for related tools\n- Best practices guides\n- Community examples and tutorials\n\n## Related Skills\n\nPart of the **Visual Content** skill category.\nTags: diagrams, mermaid, charts, visualization, presentations\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-20T05:07:51.818Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Visual Content Agents requiring automated presentation slide outlining capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要自动化演示文稿大纲的视觉内容代理。","ja":"ビジュアルコンテンツエージェントが自動化されたプレゼンテーションスライドのアウトライン機能を必要とする場合に適しています。","ko":"자동화된 프레젠테이션 슬라이드 아웃라인 기능이 필요한 시각적 콘텐츠 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de contenido visual que requieren capacidades automatizadas de esquema de diapositivas de presentación.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de contenu visuel nécessitant des capacités de planification automatique de diapositives de présentation.","de":"Ideal für visuelle Inhaltsagenten, die automatisierte Präsentationsfolien-Gliederungsfunktionen erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Conteúdo Visual que exigem capacidades de esboço automatizado de slides de apresentação.","ru":"Идеально подходит для Визуальных Контент Агентов, требующих автоматизированных возможностей для создания презентационных слайдов.","ar":"مثالي لعميل المحتوى المرئي الذي يتطلب возможности عرض شرائح تقديمية آلية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate well-structured presentation slides using visual content skills, covering diagrams, charts, and visual documentation tools, and provides step-by-step guidance for effective slide creation.","zh":"赋予代理人使用视觉内容技能生成结构良好的演示文稿幻灯片的能力，涵盖图表、图形和视觉文档工具，并为有效的幻灯片创建提供一步一步的指导。","ja":"ビジュアルコンテンツスキルを使用して構造化されたプレゼンテーションスライドを生成するエージェントの能力を提供し、図やグラフ、視覚的ドキュメントツールをカバーし、効果的なスライド作成のためのステップバイステップのガイダンスを提供します。","ko":"비주얼 콘텐츠 스킬을 사용하여 구조화된 프레젠테이션 슬라이드를 생성할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 제공하며, 도표, 차트, 시각적 문서 도구를 포함하며, 효과적인 슬라이드 생성을 위한 단계별 가이드를 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar diapositivas de presentación bien estructuradas utilizando habilidades de contenido visual, que cubren diagramas, gráficos y herramientas de documentación visual, y proporciona orientación paso a paso para una creación eficaz de diapositivas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des diapositives de présentation bien structurées en utilisant des compétences en contenu visuel, couvrant des diagrammes, des graphiques et des outils de documentation visuelle, et fournit une guidance étape par étape pour une création efficace de diapositives.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, gut strukturierte Präsentationsfolien mithilfe visueller Inhaltsfähigkeiten zu generieren, die Diagramme, Grafiken und visuelle Dokumentationswerkzeuge abdecken, und bietet schrittweise Anleitung für eine effektive FolienErstellung.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar slides de apresentação bem estruturados usando habilidades de conteúdo visual, cobrindo diagramas, gráficos e ferramentas de documentação visual, e fornece orientação passo a passo para a criação eficaz de slides.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать хорошо структурированные презентационные слайды, используя навыки визуального контента, охватывающие диаграммы, графики и визуальные инструменты документации, и предоставляет пошаговое руководство для эффективного создания слайдов.","ar"