de testes para agentes de IA","ru":"E2E - это рабочий процесс тестирования, координирующий создание и проверку тестов для ИИ Агентов","ar":"E2E هو سير عمل اختبار ينسق إنشاء ومراجعة الاختبارات لوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي"},"features":{"en":["Coordinates E2E test creation and verification using Docker Compose","Invokes specialized agents in sequence and verifies outcomes","Supports local app development with `make dev` command","Utilizes feature files (e.g., `specs/scenarios/scenario-editor.feature`) for test input","Requires E2E infrastructure setup with `cd agentic-e2e-tests && docker compose up -d`","Enables LLM evaluations and AI agent testing with OpenAI integration"],"zh":["支持LLM评估和AI Agent测试","提供E2E测试生成工作流","集成Docker Compose和Make Dev","支持Feature文件路径输入","提供Prerequisites和Input验证"],"ja":["LLM評価とAIエージェントのテストをサポート","E2Eテスト生成ワークフローを提供","Docker ComposeとMake Devを統合","Featureファイルパスの入力をサポート","PrerequisitesとInputの検証を提供"],"ko":["LLM 평가 및 AI 에이전트 테스트 지원","E2E 테스트 생성 워크플로우 제공","Docker Compose 및 Make Dev 통합","Feature 파일 경로 입력 지원","Prerequisites 및 Input 검증 제공"],"es":["Creación y verificación de pruebas de extremo a extremo","Invocación de agentes especializados en secuencia","Verificación del resultado de las pruebas","Integración con infraestructura de pruebas de extremo a extremo","Soporte para la evaluación de funcionalidades implementadas","Uso de tecnologías como Docker y Make para la ejecución de pruebas"],"fr":["Création et vérification de tests de bout en bout","Invocation d''agents spécialisés en séquence","Vérification du résultat des tests","Intégration avec l''infrastructure de tests de bout en bout","Support pour l''évaluation des fonctionnalités implémentées","Utilisation de technologies comme Docker et Make pour l''exécution des tests"],"de":["Erstellung und Überprüfung von End-to-End-Tests","Aufruf von spezialisierten Agents in Sequenz","Überprüfung des Ergebnisses der Tests","Integration mit der Infrastruktur für End-to-End-Tests","Unterstützung für die Bewertung von implementierten Funktionalitäten","Verwendung von Technologien wie Docker und Make für die Ausführung von Tests"],"pt":["Coordenação de testes E2E para agentes de IA","Suporte a LLM e especialização em LLM","Integração com Docker Compose","Verificação de resultados de testes","Suporte a feature files e cenários de teste"],"ru":["Координация тестов E2E для ИИ Агентов","Поддержка LLM и специализация на LLM","Интеграция с Docker Compose","Проверка результатов тестов","Поддержка файлов функций и сценариев тестирования"],"ar":["تنسيق اختبارات E2E لوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","دعم LLM وتخصص في LLM","التكامل مع Docker Compose","مراجعة نتائج الاختبارات","دعم ملفات الميزات وسيناريوهات الاختبار"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use e2e for AI agent testing","e2e vs OpenAI","e2e setup guide for LLM evaluations","what is e2e in AI development","e2e alternative for end-to-end testing","e2e install for Docker Compose","e2e workflow for AI agent development","e2e testing for Large Language Models","e2e and LLM-ops integration"],"zh":["E2E测试","LLM评估","AI Agent测试","Docker Compose","Make Dev","Feature文件路径","Prerequisites","Input验证","AI工具","AIエージェント"],"ja":["E2Eテスト","LLM評価","AIエージェントテスト","Docker Compose","Make Dev","Featureファイルパス","Prerequisites","Input検証","AIツール","AIエージェント"],"ko":["E2E 테스트","LLM 평가","AI 에이전트 테스트","Docker Compose","Make Dev","Feature 파일 경로","Prerequisites","Input 검증","AI 도구","AI 에이전트"],"es":["pruebas de agentes de inteligencia artificial","evaluación de funcionalidades","tests de extremo a extremo","e2e testing","plataforma de pruebas para AI","integración con Docker","uso de Make para pruebas","evaluación de llm","pruebas de llm-ops"],"fr":["tests d''agents d''intelligence artificielle","évaluation de fonctionnalités","tests de bout en bout","e2e testing","plateforme de tests pour l''IA","intégration avec Docker","utilisation de Make pour les tests","évaluation de llm","tests de llm-ops"],"de":["Tests von KI-Agents","Bewertung von Funktionalitäten","End-to-End-Tests","e2e-Testing","Testplattform für KI","Integration mit Docker","Verwendung von Make für Tests","Bewertung von llm","Tests von llm-ops"],"pt":["testes de agentes de IA","fluxo de trabalho de teste E2E","LLM","Docker Compose","verificação de resultados de testes","feature files","cenários de teste","desenvolvimento de software","engenharia de software"],"ru":["тестирование ИИ Агентов","рабочий процесс тестирования E2E","LLM","Docker Compose","проверка результатов тестов","файлы функций","сценарии тестирования","разработка программного обеспечения","инженерия программного обеспечения"],"ar":["اختبار وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","سير عمل اختبار E2E","LLM","Docker Compose","مراجعة نتائج الاختبارات","ملفات الميزات","سيناريوهات الاختبار","تطوير البرمجيات","هندسة البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"langwatch","repo":"langwatch","repoPath":"langwatch/langwatch","stars":2833,"forks":254,"updatedAt":"2026-02-24T16:59:56Z","topics":["ai","analytics","datasets","dspy","evaluation","gpt","llm","llm-ops","llmops","low-code","observability","openai","prompt-engineering"],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"e2e","description":"Generate and verify E2E tests for a feature. Explores live app, creates test plan, generates tests, runs and fixes until passing.","bodyPreview":"# E2E Test Generation Workflow\n\nYou coordinate E2E test creation and verification. You invoke specialized agents in sequence and verify the outcome.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nBefore running this workflow:\n1. The app must be running locally (`make dev` or equivalent)\n2. E2E infrastructure must be up (`cd agentic-e2e-tests && docker compose up -d`)\n3. The feature should already be implemented and reviewed\n\n## Input\n\nYou receive either:\n- A feature file path (e.g., `specs/scenarios/scenario-editor.feature","body":"# E2E Test Generation Workflow\n\nYou coordinate E2E test creation and verification. You invoke specialized agents in sequence and verify the outcome.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nBefore running this workflow:\n1. The app must be running locally (`make dev` or equivalent)\n2. E2E infrastructure must be up (`cd agentic-e2e-tests && docker compose up -d`)\n3. The feature should already be implemented and reviewed\n\n## Input\n\nYou receive either:\n- A feature file path (e.g., `specs/scenarios/scenario-editor.feature`)\n- A scenario description to verify\n\nExtract the `@e2e` tagged scenarios from the feature file if provided.\n\n## Workflow\n\n### 1. Explore and Plan\n\nInvoke the `playwright-test-planner` agent via Task tool:\n\n```\nTask(subagent_type: \"playwright-test-planner\", prompt: \"\"\"\nExplore the live app at http://localhost:5570 and create a test plan for:\n\n<scenarios>\n[List the @e2e scenarios from the feature file]\n</scenarios>\n\nFocus on:\n- Discovering the actual UI elements and navigation\n- Creating step-by-step test plans that match the scenarios\n- Documenting expected outcomes\n\nSave the plan to: agentic-e2e-tests/plans/[feature-name].plan.md\n\"\"\")\n```\n\n**Verify:** Plan file exists and covers all scenarios.\n\n### 2. Generate Tests\n\nInvoke the `playwright-test-generator` agent via Task tool:\n\n```\nTask(subagent_type: \"playwright-test-generator\", prompt: \"\"\"\nGenerate Playwright tests from the test plan:\n\n<plan-file>agentic-e2e-tests/plans/[feature-name].plan.md</plan-file>\n\nFor each scenario in the plan:\n1. Set up the page using generator_setup_page\n2. Execute each step in the browser\n3. Generate the test code from the execution log\n4. Save to: agentic-e2e-tests/tests/[feature-name]/[scenario-name].spec.ts\n\nFollow the project conventions in agentic-e2e-tests/README.md:\n- Use step functions from steps.ts (Given/When/Then naming)\n- Handle Chakra UI duplicates with .last()\n- No \"should\" in test names\n\"\"\")\n```\n\n**Verify:** Test files exist for each scenario.\n\n### 3. Run and Heal\n\nInvoke the `playwright-test-healer` agent via Task tool:\n\n```\nTask(subagent_type: \"playwright-test-healer\", prompt: \"\"\"\nRun and fix the generated E2E tests:\n\n1. Run all tests in agentic-e2e-tests/tests/[feature-name]/\n2. For any failures, diagnose the root cause:\n\n   **Test Issue** (healer fixes):\n   - Wrong selector (element changed)\n   - Timing issue (race condition)\n   - Incorrect assertion syntax\n   - Missing wait or setup step\n\n   **App Bug** (needs code fix):\n   - Feature doesn''t work as specified\n   - Expected element/behavior missing\n   - Error thrown during user flow\n   - Data not saved/displayed correctly\n\n3. For test issues: fix and re-run\n4. For app bugs: mark as test.fixme() with detailed explanation:\n   - What the spec expects\n   - What the app actually does\n   - Why this is an app bug, not a test issue\n\nContinue until all tests pass or are marked fixme with clear rationale.\n\"\"\")\n```\n\n**Verify:**\n- All tests pass → continue to review\n- Tests marked fixme → examine rationale to determine if app bug or inconclusive\n\n### 4. Review Tests (Optional)\n\nIf tests required significant healing, invoke `test-reviewer`:\n\n```\nTask(subagent_type: \"test-reviewer\", prompt: \"\"\"\nReview the E2E tests in agentic-e2e-tests/tests/[feature-name]/\n\nFocus on:\n- Naming conventions (no \"should\")\n- Proper pyramid placement (these should be E2E, not integration)\n- Step function quality\n- Locator robustness\n\"\"\")\n```\n\n## Output\n\nReturn a summary to the orchestrator with clear status:\n\n### If All Tests Pass\n```\n## E2E Verification Complete ✓\n\n**Feature:** [feature name]\n**Scenarios Tested:** [count]\n**Status:** ALL PASSING\n\n### Tests Generated\n- [test-file-1.spec.ts] - passing\n- [test-file-2.spec.ts] - passing\n\n### Coverage\n- [scenario 1] ✓ covered\n- [scenario 2] ✓ covered\n```\n\n### If Tests Fail Due to App Bugs\n```\n## E2E Verification Failed - App Bug Detected\n\n**Feature:** [feature name]\n**Status:** NEEDS CODE FIX\n\n### Failing Scenarios\n- **Scenario:** [scenario name]\n  **Expected:** [what the spec says should happen]\n  **Actual:** [what the app actually does]\n  **Evidence:** [screenshot path or error details]\n\n### Recommendation\nThe implementation does not match the spec. Send back to /code with:\n- Scenario: [scenario name]\n- Expected behavior: [from spec]\n- Actual behavior: [observed]\n- Fix needed: [specific change required]\n```\n\n### If Tests Marked as Fixme (Inconclusive)\n```\n## E2E Verification Partial\n\n**Feature:** [feature name]\n**Status:** NEEDS REVIEW\n\n### Tests with Issues\n- [test-file.spec.ts] - marked fixme\n  **Reason:** [why it couldn''t be determined if app or test is wrong]\n\n### Recommendation\nManual review needed to determine if this is an app bug or test issue.\n```\n\n## Boundaries\n\nYou coordinate, you don''t write tests directly:\n- `playwright-test-planner` explores and plans\n- `playwright-test-generator` generates tests\n- `playwright-test-healer` fixes failures\n- `test-reviewer` checks quality\n\nYou verify outcomes and report status.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-06T06:25:14.920Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing comprehensive end-to-end test creation and verification capabilities using Docker and OpenAI","zh":"适合需要使用Docker和OpenAI进行全面端到端测试创建和验证功能的AI代理","ja":"DockerとOpenAIを使用した包括的なエンドツーエンドテスト作成および検証機能を必要とするAIエージェントに最適","ko":"Docker와 OpenAI를 사용하여 종단간 테스트 생성 및 검증 기능을 toàn diện하게 필요한 AI 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA que necesitan capacidades de creación y verificación de pruebas integrales de extremo a extremo utilizando Docker y OpenAI","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA nécessitant une création et une vérification de tests complets de bout en bout en utilisant Docker et OpenAI","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die umfassende End-to-End-Test-Erstellungs- und Verifizierungsfunktionen mit Docker und OpenAI benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA que necessitam de capacidades de criação e verificação de testes abrangentes de ponta a ponta usando Docker e OpenAI","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, которым необходимы всесторонние возможности создания и проверки тестов от начала до конца с использованием Docker и OpenAI","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي الذي يحتاج إلى إمكانيات شاملة لإنشاء اختبارات وتأكيد من النهاية إلى النهاية باستخدام Docker و OpenAI"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to coordinate E2E test creation and verification, utilizing technologies like Docker and OpenAI, and supporting LLM evaluations with specialized agents and outcome verification through protocols like feature file paths","zh":"赋予代理协调端到端测试创建和验证的能力，利用诸如Docker和OpenAI等技术，并支持LLM评估，通过特性文件路径等协议进行专业代理和结果验证","ja":"エージェントにエンドツーエンドテスト作成および検証の調整機能を与え、DockerやOpenAIなどの技術を利用し、LLM評価をサポートし、特性ファイルパスなどのプロトコルを介して専門エージェントおよび結果の検証を実行","ko":"에이전트에 종단간 테스트 생성 및 검증을 조정할 수 있는 능력을 부여하고 Docker나 OpenAI 등의 기술을 활용하며 LLM 평가를 지원하고 특성 파일 경로 등의 프로토콜을 통해 전문 에이전트 및 결과 검증을 수행","es":"Habilita a los agentes a coordinar la creación y verificación de pruebas de extremo a extremo, utilizando tecnologías como Docker y OpenAI, y apoyando evaluaciones de LLM con agentes especializados y verificación de resultados a través de protocolos como rutas de archivos de características","fr":"Permet aux agents de coordonner la création et la vérification de tests de bout en bout, en utilisant des technologies comme Docker et OpenAI, et en prenant en charge les évaluations de LLM avec des agents spécialisés et la vérification des résultats via des protocoles comme les chemins de fichiers de fonctionnalités","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, die Erstellung und Verifizierung von End-to-End-Tests zu koordinieren, indem Technologien wie Docker und OpenAI verwendet werden, und unterstützt LLM-Bewertungen mit spezialisierten Agenten und Ergebnisverifizierung durch Protokolle wie Feature-Dateipfade","pt":"Habilita os agentes a coordenar a criação e verificação de testes de ponta a ponta, utilizando tecnologias como Docker e OpenAI, e apoiando avaliações de LLM com agentes especializados e verificação de resultados por meio de protocolos como caminhos de arquivos de recursos","ru":"Предоставляет агентам возможность координировать создание и проверку тестов от начала до конца, используя технологии như Docker и OpenAI, и поддерживает оценки LLM с помощью специализированных агентов и проверку результатов через протоколы, такие как пути к файлам функций","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من تنسيق إنشاء اختبارات وتأكيد من النهاية إلى النهاية، باستخدام تقنيات مثل Docker و OpenAI، ودعم تقييمات LLM مع وكلاء متخصصين وتأكيد النتائج من خلال بروتوكولات مثل مسارات الملفات الميزة"},"useCases":{"en":["Coordinating E2E test creation and verification for AI agents","Invoking specialized agents in sequence for outcome verification","Verifying E2E infrastructure setup using docker compose"],"zh":["为AI代理协调端到端测试创建和验证","顺序调用专业代理以进行结果验证","使用docker compose验证端到端基础设施设置"],"ja":["AIエージェントのエンドツーエンドテスト作成および検証の調整","結果検証のために専門エージェントを順序に呼び出す","docker composeを使用したエンドツーエンドインフラストラクチャ設定の検証"],"ko":["AI 에이전트를 위한 종단간 테스트 생성 및 검증을 조정","결과 검증을 위해 전문 에이전트를 순차적으로 호출","docker compose를 사용하여 종단간 인프라 설정을 검증"],"es":["Coordinar la creación y verificación de pruebas de extremo a extremo para agentes de IA","Llamar a agentes especializados en secuencia para la verificación de resultados","Verificar la configuración de la infraestructura de extremo a extremo utilizando docker compose"],"fr":["Coordonner la création et la vérification de tests de bout en bout pour les agents IA","Appeler des agents spécialisés en séquence pour la vérification des résultats","Vérifier la configuration de l''infrastructure de bout en bout en utilisant docker compose"],"de":["Koordinieren der Erstellung und Verifizierung von End-to-End-Tests für KI-Agents","Aufrufen von spezialisierten Agenten in einer Sequenz zur Ergebnisverifizierung","Verifizieren der End-to-End-Infrastruktur-Einrichtung mit docker compose"],"pt":["Coordenar a criação e verificação de testes de ponta a ponta para agentes de IA","Invocar agentes especializados em sequência para verificação de resultados","Verificar a configuração da infraestrutura de ponta a ponta usando docker compose"],"ru":["Координировать создание и проверку тестов от начала до конца для агентов ИИ","Вызывать специализированные агенты в последовательности для проверки результатов","Проверять настройку инфраструктуры от начала до конца с использованием docker compose"],"ar":["تنسيق إنشاء اختبارات وتأكيد من النهاية إلى النهاية لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي","استدعاء وكلاء متخصصين بالتسلسل لتأكيد النتائج","التأكد من إعداد البنية التحتية من النهاية إلى النهاية باستخدام docker compose"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires local app setup with ''make dev'' or equivalent","E2E infrastructure must be up with ''docker compose up -d''","Feature must be implemented and reviewed beforehand"],"zh":["需要使用''make dev''或等效命令进行本地应用设置","端到端基础设施必须使用''docker compose up -d''启动","功能必须事先实现和审查"],"ja":["''make dev''または同等のコマンドを使用したローカルアプリケーション設定が必要","エンドツーエンドインフラストラクチャは''docker compose up -d''で起動する必要がある","機能は事前に実装および確認する必要がある"],"ko":["''make dev'' 또는 동등한 명령어를 사용한 로컬 애플리케이션 설정이 필요","종단간 인프라스트럭처는 ''docker compose up -d''로 시작되어야 함","기능은事前に 구현 및 검토되어야 함"],"es":["Requiere una configuración de aplicación local con ''make dev'' o equivalente","La infraestructura de extremo a extremo debe estar arriba con ''docker compose up -d''","La característica debe implementarse y revisarse con antelación"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration d''application locale avec ''make dev'' ou équivalent","L''infrastructure de bout en bout doit être lancée avec ''docker compose up -d''","La fonctionnalité doit être implémentée et examinée au préalable"],"de":["Benötigt eine lokale App-Einrichtung mit ''make dev'' oder äquivalent","Die End-to-End-Infrastruktur muss mit ''docker compose up -d'' hochgefahren werden","Das Feature muss vorher implementiert und überprüft werden"],"pt":["Requer configuração de aplicativo local com ''make dev'' ou equivalente","A infraestrutura de ponta a ponta deve estar ativa com ''docker compose up -d''","A funcionalidade deve ser implementada e revisada anteriormente"],"ru":["Требует локальной настройки приложения с ''make dev'' или эквивалентной","Инфраструктура от начала до конца должна быть включена с ''docker compose up -d''","Функция должна быть реализована и рассмотрена заранее"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد تطبيق محلي مع ''make dev'' أو ما يعادله","يجب أن تكون البنية التحتية من النهاية إلى النهاية نشطة مع ''docker compose up -d''","يجب أن تكون الميزة مطبقة ومراجعة مسبقا"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"63e2b31f0fbd4aaed2474d2be69213131ebe35498abcea6fbf953d76de82a05f","qualityScore":64}');
