INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('langwatch/langwatch/e2e', 'e2e', 'langwatch', 'langwatch', 'community', 'e2e langwatch langwatch community ai analytics datasets dspy evaluation gpt llm llm-ops llmops low-code observability openai prompt-engineering The e2e platform enables coordinated E2E test creation and verification for AI agents, utilizing technologies like Docker and OpenAI. It benefits developers and testers working with LLM evaluations. E2E测试生成工作流是一种协调E2E测试创建和验证的平台 E2Eテスト生成ワークフローは、E2Eテストの作成と検証を調整するためのプラットフォーム E2E 테스트 생성 워크플로우는 E2E 테스트 생성과 검증을 조정하는 플랫폼 e2e es una plataforma para evaluar y probar agentes de inteligencia artificial, que permite la creación y verificación de pruebas de extremo a extremo e2e est une plateforme pour évaluer et tester les agents d''intelligence artificielle, qui permet la création et la vérification de tests de bout en bout e2e ist eine Plattform für die Bewertung und das Testen von KI-Agents, die die Erstellung und Überprüfung von End-to-End-Tests ermöglicht O E2E é uma plataforma para avaliar e testar agentes de IA, permitindo a coordenação de testes e a verificação de resultados. E2E - это платформа для оценки и тестирования ИИ Агентов, позволяющая координировать тесты и проверять результаты. E2E هي منصة لتقييم واختبار وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي، تمكن من تنسيق الاختبارات ومراجعة النتائج. how to use e2e for AI agent testing e2e vs OpenAI e2e setup guide for LLM evaluations what is e2e in AI development e2e alternative for end-to-end testing e2e install for Docker Compose e2e workflow for AI agent development e2e testing for Large Language Models e2e and LLM-ops integration E2E测试 LLM评估 AI Agent测试 Docker Compose Make Dev Feature文件路径 Prerequisites Input验证 AI工具 AIエージェント Coordinates E2E test creation and verification using Docker Compose Invokes specialized agents in sequence and verifies outcomes Supports local app development with `make dev` command Utilizes feature files (e.g., `specs/scenarios/scenario-editor.feature`) for test input Requires E2E infrastructure setup with `cd agentic-e2e-tests && docker compose up -d` Enables LLM evaluations and AI agent testing with OpenAI integration e2e is a platform for Large Language Model (LLM) evaluations and AI agent testing, facilitating end-to-end test generation and verification workflows.');
