INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('getsentry/skills/doc-coauthoring', 'doc-coauthoring', 'getsentry', 'skills', 'official', 'doc-coauthoring getsentry skills official tag-production The doc-coauthoring skill guides users through a structured workflow for co-authoring documentation, helping them efficiently transfer context and refine content. This skill benefits developers and technical writers working on documentation tasks. doc-coauthoring技能提供结构化的工作流程，引导用户完成文档协作，包括上下文收集、内容完善和读者测试 doc-coauthoringスキルは、ドキュメント共同作成を促進するための構造化されたワークフローを提供し、コンテキストの収集、内容の洗練、読者テストを含む doc-coauthoring 기능은 문서 공저를 위한 구조화된 워크플로우를 제공하여 사용자가 효율적으로 문서를 생성하고 향상시킬 수 있도록 합니다 El skill de coautoría de documentos proporciona un flujo de trabajo estructurado para guiar a los usuarios en la creación colaborativa de documentos La compétence de co-rédaction de documents fournit un workflow structuré pour guider les utilisateurs dans la création collaborative de documents Die Fähigkeit zur gemeinsamen Erstellung von Dokumenten bietet einen strukturierten Workflow, um Benutzer bei der kollaborativen Erstellung von Dokumenten zu unterstützen O fluxo de coautoria de documentos é uma ferramenta que ajuda a guiar os usuários através de uma estrutura de trabalho colaborativa Сотрудничество над документами - это инструмент, который помогает пользователям работать вместе над созданием контента أداة التعاون في كتابة الوثائق هي أداة تساعد المستخدمين على العمل معاً في إطار عمل مشترك how to use doc-coauthoring doc-coauthoring workflow collaborative documentation tools doc-coauthoring alternative doc-coauthoring setup guide doc-coauthoring for technical writers doc-coauthoring vs traditional documentation methods install doc-coauthoring doc-coauthoring best practices 文档协作 AI工具 技术文档 团队效率 文档质量 结构化工作流程 上下文收集 内容完善 读者测试 Guides users through a three-stage workflow: Context Gathering, Refinement & Structure, and Reader Testing Triggers on user mentions of writing documentation, such as "write a doc" or "draft a proposal" Supports specific doc types, including PRD, design doc, decision doc, and RFC Helps users refine content through iteration and verify documentation effectiveness doc-coauthoring is a collaborative documentation workflow that guides users through context gathering, refinement, and reader testing to create effective documentation');
